WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.894
Kip was reading a newspaper.

2
00:00:09.895 --> 00:00:14.152
He saw an ad for Ocean Aquarium.

3
00:00:14.153 --> 00:00:18.587
"Hmm . . . ," thought Kip.

4
00:00:18.588 --> 00:00:21.472
"The aquarium looks like fun.

5
00:00:21.473 --> 00:00:31.002
Maybe Bird would like to go with me."

6
00:00:31.003 --> 00:00:35.470
Kip climbed up the tree.

7
00:00:35.471 --> 00:00:40.729
"Hey, Bird," he called. "Do you want to . . .?"

8
00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:43.453
But Bird was not in her nest.

9
00:00:43.454 --> 00:00:51.314
"Where is Bird?" Kip wondered.

10
00:00:51.315 --> 00:00:55.603
Kip climbed back down the tree.

11
00:00:55.604 --> 00:00:59.179
"She must be somewhere around here," he said.

12
00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:09.667
"I'll go and look for her."

13
00:01:09.668 --> 00:01:14.825
Meanwhile Bird was reading a newspaper too.

14
00:01:14.826 --> 00:01:21.236
"Hmm . . . ," thought Bird.

15
00:01:21.237 --> 00:01:24.984
"The aquarium looks like fun.

16
00:01:24.985 --> 00:01:30.827
Maybe Kip would like to go with me."

17
00:01:30.828 --> 00:01:36.594
Bird flew back to the tree.

18
00:01:36.595 --> 00:01:45.475
"Hey, Kip," she called. "Do you want to—?"

19
00:01:45.476 --> 00:01:50.340
But Kip was not in his hole.

20
00:01:50.341 --> 00:01:53.654
"Where is Kip?" Bird wondered.

